<item><title>Egypt takes 32% of Russian tour-package sales in November</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-takes-32-of-russian-tour-package-sales-in-november-6a069e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egypt-takes-32-of-russian-tour-package-sales-in-november-6a069e/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>Tourism officials say Egypt&apos;s share rose from last year, while Asian destinations compete for Russian visitors.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:15:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" length="31241" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
