<item><title>Egyptian Red Crescent sends 3,445 tonnes of winter aid to Gaza</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egyptian-red-crescent-sends-3-445-tonnes-of-winter-aid-to-d649c0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/eg/egyptian-red-crescent-sends-3-445-tonnes-of-winter-aid-to-d649c0/</guid><category>Egypt</category><description>Its 317th convoy, sent early on Sunday, also carried food, medical supplies and 591 tonnes of fuel for bakeries and hospitals.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:50:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" length="31241" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/eg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
